  [PASS] E5 [FOR ALL n] in this family 1 - c_s^2 = n u / (u(1+u)^n + (1+u)^n - u - 1 + n u); for n >= 1 every term of the denominator is >= 0 and the first is > 0, so c_s^2 < 1 -- health holds for every n, not just 1, 2, 3
         measured : 1 - c_s^2 = n*u/(n*u + u*(u + 1)**n - u + (u + 1)**n - 1)
